<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">MUH - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Muh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Muhanûzi</para>
  <para style="toc1">OMUHANÛZI</para>
  <para style="h">Omuhanûzi</para>
  <para style="mt1">OMUHANÛZI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Ecigabi cirhanzi c’eci citabu ciderhwa: «Ebinwa by’Omuhanûzi». Omu cihebraniya Omuhanûzi aderhwa Koheleti. Koheleti kwo kuderha: omuntu ohanûla omu ndêko. Omuhanûzi anacîderhe «Mwâna wa Daudi Mwâmi w’e Yeruzalemu». Kwo binali, owayandikaga eci citabu arhali Salomoni, ci wundi muntu waderhaga mpu Salomoni ye waciyandikaga. Owayandikaga eci citabu alonzagya engerêrezo zâge zifungirwe n’omuntu mukengwa bwenêne. Eci citabu cirharhondekanya bwinja ebinwa. Cinakavanga engerêrezo n’okugalukagaluka omu binwa byashambîrwe mîra. «Busha buno, ngasi kantu koshi kabà ka busha» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 1:2">1, 2</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:8">12, 8</ref></char>). Akalamo k’omuntu ebà ntondekanye y’ebijiro bya ngasi lubero birhagwêrhi nda na mugongo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 3:1-11">3, 1-11</ref></char>). Akalamo kahwêra omu malibuko g’omu bushosi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 12:1-7">12, 1-7</ref></char>). Obuzinda bw’omuntu kuli kufà. Boshi kufà banafè (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 3:14-20">3, 14-20</ref></char>). Idôso ly’ecitabu c’Omuhanûzi lyo na liguma n’idôso lya Ayubu. Ishuzo ly’Omuhahûzi lidesire mpu: «Okuli kurhahemberwa hano igulu». Ayubu n’omuhanûzi bo baguma bulya omuhanûzi ali muntu orhagwêrhe malibuko. Arhalonza okushambâla ebiyêrekîre amalibuko aka Ayubu walibuzibagwa bwenêne. Omuhanûzi abona kwône oku amasîma ga hano igulu gabà ga busha. Acîrhûliriza n’obushagaluke busungunu bw’akalamo ka hano igulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 3:12-13">3, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:15">8, 15</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:7-9">9, 7-9</ref></char>). Omuhanûzi ali muntu wa buyêmêre, cikwône orhadêkereza murhima kulya kubà akalamo k’abantu karhegekwa na Nyamuzinda. Omuhanûzi ayêmêra okurhahêka Nyamuzinda lubanja (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 3:11-14">3, 11-14</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:13">7, 13</ref></char>). Okushimba amarhegeko ga Nnâmahanga n’okumukenga kuli kwa bulagîrire bulya Ye yishi byoshi. Ecitabu c’Omuhanûzi ciyêrekana okujà enyanya kw’enyigîrizo z’idini, cirhuyigîriza oku kurhegesirwe okuyâka akalamo k’oburhogozi ka hano igulu. Obugale burhankalêrha akalamo kinjà kw’okuli.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ecigabi cirhanzi: Akalamo ka Salomoni: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 1:1-2:26">1, 1—2, 26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ecigabi ca kabirhi: Okufà n’omulala: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 3:1-16">3, 1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ecigabi ca kasharhu: Amahano ga ngasi lubero: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="ECC 7:1-12:14">7, 1—12, 14</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1"/>Emyanzi y’Omuhanûzi Koheleti, mwene Daudi, mwâmi w’e Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">Ecigabi cirhanzi Enshula-mwanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2"/>Busha-busha, gwârhi omuhanûzi Koheleti, busha bwenêne. Byoshi bunabà busha. <verse eid="ECC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3"/>Bunguke buci omuntu akûla omu kurhama arhama hano îdako ly’izûba? <verse eid="ECC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4"/>Abarhanzi banagende, abandi bayishe, erhi n’igulu ho linayôsire liri. <verse eid="ECC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5"/>Onabone izûba linyonyôke, izûba lizike, obone ligende lihike, lijinyonyôkera emunda lyajâga. <verse eid="ECC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6"/>Empûsi onabone erhenge njir’îdako eyêrekere njira-nyanya, obone erhangibinduluka, kandi ehârhûle. <verse eid="ECC 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7"/>Enyîshi zoshi ebwa nyanja zija n’enyanja erhanayunjule, n’enyîshi zirhahwa zirhabululira emunda zâhwêra. <verse eid="ECC 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8"/>Ntâco cirharhamya. Ntâye wakaderha mpu aga masù garhabonaga obu, nîsi erhi mpu aga marhwiri garhasag’iyumva gasîme!<verse eid="ECC 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9"/>Okwàli kwo kwanabà, n’okwabîre kwacibà; na ntà kantu kahyâhya hanôla îdako ly’izûba. <verse eid="ECC 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10"/>Nka kula akantu baderhire, mpu: «lâba! mpu kahyâhya aka!» Okwôla kukola kubîre omu gandi mango. <verse eid="ECC 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11"/>Ci bulya kwône ntâye ocikengîre ebya mîra; ciru n’enyuma, ntâye wakengêra omu nsiku zâyisha.<verse eid="ECC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akalamo ka Salomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12"/>Niono Koheleti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niono «Muhanûzi», kuli kuderha olya mwandisi wayandikaga ecigabi cinene c’ecîra citabu, cidesirwe oku mpu ye mwâmi Salomoni, mwâmi w’Israheli, kulya kubà ye wali muntu w’obukengêre bunji.</char></note>, nali mwâmi w’Israheli, aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="ECC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13"/>Najîre aho nalongereza n’oburhimanya ebijirwa banola îdako ly’izûba byoshi. Wâni sho, bushanja bubî Nyamuzinda ahîre abantu. <verse eid="ECC 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14"/>Nasingirîze ebijirwa hanôla îdako ly’izûba: kàli byoshi kubà kurhebwa kunabâ kubiva empûsi! <verse eid="ECC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15"/>Ehiri hiniole hirhankaba hilongêdu, ehirhahali hirhankaganjirwa omu bindi.<verse eid="ECC 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16"/>Nacîderhêza niene obwo: nti oburhimanya ngwêrhe burhali bunyi, nti burhalusire abantangaga aha Yeruzalemu boshi. Nalolêrize oburhimanya bwoshi n’obumanye bwoshi. <verse eid="ECC 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17"/>Nacîyigîrize oburhimanya nayîga n’ebiyigwa, nashanga oku isirhe na buhwinja. Nayumwa oku ciru n’okwo, gali mango gafire busha. <verse eid="ECC 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18"/>Burhimanya bunji, mutula munji, obumanye oku buli bunji kwo bunarhamya.<verse eid="ECC 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1"/>Naderha obwo: nti nkola narhangirerêza n’ebinuna: lâba iragi! nakwo kurhebwa. <verse eid="ECC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2"/>Amasheka, nti: isirhe! Ebinuna nti cirigi cici? <verse eid="ECC 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3"/>Nalonza okugereka omubiri gwâni omu ndalwè, n’omurhima nagubêza omu burhimanya; nalonza okucishwekera oku isirhe, nti nyumwe obununu abantu bayumva, n’ebi bajira omu buzîne bwâbo banôla îdako ly’izûba. <verse eid="ECC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4"/>Najà omu by’obukulu, nayûbaka enyumpa nènênè, nahinga ishwa ly’emizâbîbu. <verse eid="ECC 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5"/>Njira amasâne n’emirhi y’amalehe, ntà mulehe ntahiragamwo. <verse eid="ECC 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6"/>Nasîka ebiyanja by’amîshi nti nkazidômereramwo amasâne. <verse eid="ECC 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7"/>Nabona nashîgwa n’abashizi, nashîgwa n’abajanyere. Naluza abantu, naluza n’ebintu, enkafu n’ebibuzi, kulya kurhasagiboneka bundi aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="ECC 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8"/>Nalundûla ensaranga n’amasholo, nayûbaka ecibîkiro c’abâmi naluza n’ebihugo; najâho nalâlika abimbiza b’abalume n’ab’abakazi, ebi abantu balimbamwo byoshî, nabumba amasanduku n’amasanduku. <verse eid="ECC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9"/>Nagala narhaluka abantangaga aha Yeruzalemu, erhi nangwêrhage n’obushinganyanya obwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oku biyêrekîre obugale bwa mwâmi Salomini, lolà muli <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:14-25">1 Bâm 10, 14-25</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2 Nga 9, 13-28</ref></char>; oku biyêrekîre obushinganyanya bwâge, olole muli <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 3-4">1 Bâm 3—4</ref></char>. 2, 12: Akabà kwo binali oburhimanya n’obwenge bijira amakwânane manji, ago makwânane galî ga busha bulya abandi bantu banagashereze, bulya oburhimanya n’obwenge byoshi kuhwa byanâcihwe.</char></note>. <verse eid="ECC 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10"/>Eb'îsù lisîma byoshi nalihâbyo, ngasi hinunu omurhima gusîma hyoshi, ntâhyo naguyîmire, omukolo gwâni gwoshi nayumva gunansimîsize, kwabâ kwo na kwâni omu mirimo yoshi. <verse eid="ECC 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11"/>Nagerêreza ebiyêrekîre emikolo amaboko gâni gakola, n’ebiyêrekîre okurhama narhamire, nti kwoshi kwamabà kurhebwa, nti na ntà bunguke bubà hanôla igulu.<verse eid="ECC 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12"/>Nadôsa emirhima oku biyêrekîre oburhimanya, obuhwinja n’isirhe. Ka ndolage! owayîma omu bya mwâmi bici ajira? Bici byajizirwe!. <verse eid="ECC 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13"/>Mbwînage nêci oku oburhimanya bwo bukulu oku isirhe, n’omûshi gwo mukulu aha budufu: <verse eid="ECC 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14"/>Omurhimanya anabone aha agera, oku omusirhe ajà atunduza. Kubâge! Ci kwône mmanyire oku bombi obuzinda bwâbo buli buguma.<verse eid="ECC 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15"/>Naderha obwo, nti oku omusirhe ayishibà kwo n’omurhimanya ayishibà, akabà ntyo, oburhimanya buligi bwa cici? Naderha obwo nti nakwo kunali kurhebwa. <verse eid="ECC 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16"/>Bulyâla ntâye okengêrwa kasanzi, ôli omurhimanya, ôli omusirhe; erhi ensiku zinalondana nka kanga, erhi bamânayibagira bombi na bombi; omurhimanya kufà anafà aka omusirhe. <verse eid="ECC 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17"/>Akalamo ntakakwirirwa, bulyâla okubà hanôla igulu ntà kusîma; byoshi kuli kurhebwa, ganali mango gafire busha.<verse eid="ECC 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18"/>Ntasîma bankwîrize omukolo nakozire hanôla igulu, omukolo ndekîre omwâna wayishiyîma omu byâni. <verse eid="ECC 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19"/>Câba mushâna, ndi omanyire erhi ayishibà murhimanya erhi musirhe? Ye wanayishiyîma omu mirimo yâni yoshi, muli ebîra byajàgamwo entûbano n’oburhimanya bw’obuzîne bwâni bwoshi. Nanga kuli kurhebwa kunali kuhaba lwoshi. <verse eid="ECC 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20"/>Mpakanyirage okurhama narhamire hano igulu.<verse eid="ECC 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21"/>Omuntu wakozire n’oburhimanya, n’obulenga, anayêrekana oku ahashire, ebyâge abisigîre omwôlo! <verse eid="ECC 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22"/>Bunguke buci akûzirage omu kurhama arhamire, omu misî yoshi ajizire, amango acihali? <verse eid="ECC 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23"/>N’ensiku zâge z’amalibuko, n’okugendêrera akazâgigendêrera ebyâge, n’okurhanya akazâgilâla arhanya? Kurhebwa okwo hacu.<verse eid="ECC 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24"/>Okusîma kw’omuntu, kunali okulya n’okunywa, n’amango minjà omu mukolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omwandisi arhamanyiri bwinjinjà kurhi akalamo k’omuntu kayishiyôrha enyuma ly’okufà kwâge, na ntyo, arhankahashishuza bwinjà.</char></note>. Kwo nambona nk’ebyo byoshi omu nfune za Nyamuzinda birhenga, <verse eid="ECC 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25"/>bulyâla obugale n’obukenyi Nyamuzinda birhengakwo: <verse eid="ECC 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26"/>oyu alonzize anamuhè okurhimanya, okumanya n’okusîma, anarhume n’omunya-byâha mpu alongeze analundikire oyu Nyamuzinda arhonyize, nanga, okwo kuli kurhebwa ganali mango gafire busha.<verse eid="ECC 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Olufù</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1"/>Ngasi kantu kajira amango gako, habà n’amango g’okukola ngasi kantu kanali îdako ly’izûba.<verse eid="ECC 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2"/>Habà amango g’okuburha n’amango g’okufà; amango g’okurhwêra, n’amango g’okurhwerûla.<verse eid="ECC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3"/>Habà amango g’okuyîrha, n’amango g’okufumya; amango g’okushâba, n’amango g’okuyûbaka.<verse eid="ECC 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4"/>Habà amango g’okulaka, n’amango g’okusheka; n’amango g’endûlù n’aga okusâma.<verse eid="ECC 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5"/>Habà amango g’okubanda amabâle, n’amango g’okugarhôlogola; amango g’okubagalira, n’ag’okuleka okubagalira.<verse eid="ECC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6"/>Habà amango g’okulongereza, n’amango g’okuheza; amango g’okubîka, n’ag’okukabulira.<verse eid="ECC 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7"/>Habà amango g’okubera, n’amango g’okuhanga; amango g’okuganîra n’aga okuhulika. <verse eid="ECC 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8"/>Habà amango g’okurhonya, n’amango g’okushômba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">amango g’entambala n’aga omurhûla.<verse eid="ECC 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9"/>Bici omuntu akolera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omwigîriza acîdôsize bulya gurhi omuntu arhacîhangâna okukola na bici birhuma arhindibuka hano igulu? Omwigîriza ashuzize kuli elyo idôso omu mulongo gwa 10 n’ogukulikire oku Nyamuzinda ye rhegeka byoshi; rhurhakamanya ebibà Nyamuzinda emurhima, bulya rhuli barhôrho bwenêne embere zâge, co cirhumire erhi Nyamuzinda akashobôza omuntu iragi, kukwânîne ashagaluke anakome akagasha.</char></note> ebi akola? <verse eid="ECC 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10"/>Ndwîrhe nalolêreza obulenga Nyamuzinda aha abantu. <verse eid="ECC 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11"/>Ngasi ehi ajira, hikwânana amango gahyo, ci kwône omu kulola amango goshi, ebi Nyamuzinda ajira kurhenga emurhondêro kuhika ebuzinda, birhumvikana. <verse eid="ECC 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12"/>Nyumvirhage oku obusîme bw’omuntu mwône bubà omu kununirwa n’omu kushagaluka amango acihali. <verse eid="ECC 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13"/>Okulya n’okunywa, okucîhà ehisanzi omu mirimo, eri ngalo ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ECC 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14"/>Manyire oku oburhegesi bwa Nyamuzinda burhajira mihindûlo. Kala kantu karhajakwo kandi, n’akalâla karhashôsholwakwo: Nyamuzinda alonzize abantu bakazimurhînya. <verse eid="ECC 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15"/>Ehiri ene, arhali ene erhi hibà; okwayishibà, mîra kwabaga; Nyamuzinda asîma oyu bashimbulwîre.<verse eid="ECC 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16"/>Kwône ncidwîrhe nasinza hanôla igulu: aha batwîra olubanja, bushungu buhali oku ntebe y’omushinganyanya, cishungu cikuli. <verse eid="ECC 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17"/>Kwo kuderhaga: nti Nyamuzinda atwa olubanja lw’omushinganyanya, atwe n’olw’ecishungu, bu lyala hali amango g’okujirira byoshi hanôla. <verse eid="ECC 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18"/>Nashubiderha kandi obwo, nti kwo abantu banali ntyo: kuderha mpu Nyamuzinda yêne abayêrekane oku banali, anamanyîse oku: omuntu oku wâbo muntu cibà ciryanyi kula eciryanyi cinabà. <verse eid="ECC 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19"/>Nêci obuzinda bw’omuntu n’obw’ecintu bwo na buguma, omuntu anafè n’ecintu cifè bombi buzîne buguma babà bagwêrhe; eci omuntu alushire ecintu ciri ntâco. <verse eid="ECC 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20"/>Bombi haguma banajà; bombi omu budaka barhenga, n’omu budaka bashubira bombi. <verse eid="ECC 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21"/>Ndi omanyire erhi omûka gw’abantu gunasôkere enyanya, erhi omûka gw’ebintu gunayandagalire ekuzimu.<verse eid="ECC 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22"/>Niehe mbwîne oku okusîma omuntu akasîma, kunali kusîmîsibwa n’emikolo yâge kwône, bulya kwo analemirwe ntyo. Ndi wayishigimuyêreka ebyayishibà enyuma zâge?<verse eid="ECC 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Rhugende banga…</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1"/>Ncidwîrhe nasinza oku abantu barhindibuka hano igulu: lâba emirenge y’abalibuzibwa, barhanagwêrhi carhûliriza; lâba n’olunda lw’abalibuza abandi, emisî! barhagwêrhi cârhûliriza. <verse eid="ECC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2"/>Co cirhumire ncîsîmira banyakwigendera bacîfirîre kulusha abazîne bacirimwo omûka. <verse eid="ECC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3"/>Na kulusha abo bombi, ye nsîmire olya orhaciburhwa, arhanacibona amaligo gakolwa hanôla igulu. <verse eid="ECC 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4"/>Mbwîne oku ngasi kucihangâna na ngasi lubanja omuntu ayâzize, bunali bwâgalwa bw’omuntu oku wâbo. Kuli kurhebwa ganali mango gafire busha. <verse eid="ECC 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5"/>Omusirhe nderaminwe, anacîrye, gwârhi abaderha, ci kwône, <verse eid="ECC 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6"/>aha omuntu akaluha kabirhi n’okuheza amango, akaluhûka liguma lya bulume.<verse eid="ECC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubà kahumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7"/>Ncidwîrhe nabona okundi kurhebwa kubà hanôla igulu: <verse eid="ECC 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8"/>Rhuderhe omuntu ôli kahumba: orhajira mwâna arhajira na wâbo: omukolo gwâge gurhaheka, n’amasù gâge garhajira oku gankagala. Obwôla kwo biri ntyo, ndi ndwîrhage nâkolera nieki mbule bwanacîsîmîsa? Nanga birhali byo; kunali kurhebwa.<verse eid="ECC 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9"/>Abà omuntu akabà kahumba, bakabà babirhi, kulya kubà go mango omukolo gugwêrhe obunguke. <verse eid="ECC 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10"/>Erhi hankajira owakulumba, owâbo anamuzûsa: Ci kwône owakulumba nka ali yêne, arhanagwêrhi càzûsa, yêne oku lwâge: <verse eid="ECC 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11"/>N’abantu bakagwîshira babirhi banayumve idûrhu; ci oli yêne kurhi akabona idûrhu?<verse eid="ECC 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12"/>Akahumba kanakubwe, ababirhi basêre, n’olukoba lwa migozi isharhu lurhatwîka duba. <verse eid="ECC 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13"/>Omurhumba mukenyi na murhimanya ye mukulu aha mwâmi mushosi na muhwinja, orhayishidôsa ihano. <verse eid="ECC 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14"/>Omurhumba anarhenga omu mugozi ajiyanka oburhegesi, nîsi erhi aburhwe mukenyi omu bwâmi. <verse eid="ECC 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15"/>Mbwîne oku abâli buno ye barhonyize omurhumba, owa kabirhi, owashamula oburhegesi. <verse eid="ECC 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16"/>Ayimangîre olubaga lunji-lunji; ntà burhè akabà bacîyûnjuza buzinda! nêci kuli kurhebwa ganali mango gafire busha.<verse eid="ECC 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 4:17"/>Omanye igenda lyâwe nka wajà omu ka-Nyamuzinda. Ojè hôfi lyo oyumvîrhiza: enterekêro yo nkulu aha ntûlo y’abasirhe, ciru akabà barhamanyiri oku kubî bajizire.<verse eid="ECC 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1"/>Orhakazâgiderha duba-duba, orhanahîraga okahà Nyamuzinda omuhigo duba-duba; bulya Nyamuzinda yo abà emalunga nâwe hano igulu. Kwo kuderha oku orhaluzagya ebinwa: <verse eid="ECC 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2"/>Emanja nyinji zo zilêrha ebilôrho n’ebinwa binji bilêrhe okuderha nka musirhe.<verse eid="ECC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3"/>Erhi wankahà Nyamuzinda omuhigo, onacisêzagye n’okugujira, bulya Nyamuzinda arhasîma abalimwo isirhe: omuhigo wamuhîre onagusêzagye. <verse eid="ECC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4"/>Ciru, ah’omuntu ankahâna omuhigo arhakole, ankaleka bwaguhâna kwo kukulu. <verse eid="ECC 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5"/>Orhazigaga akanwa kâwe kakujira mulenzi, orhanajagibwîra malahika wâwe mpu orhakujizire n’oluhinzo. Cankarhuma wahà Nyamuzinda igwârhiro ly’okukalihira ebinwa byâwe n’ery’okushâba obûbake bw’amaboko gâwe? <verse eid="ECC 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6"/>Ebilôrho binji byo bilêrha okurhebwa, n’ebinwa binji bilêrhe okufumwa n’amango. Obwo kwo biri ntyo okazirhînya Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="ECC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7"/>Irhondo okabona banyaga omukenyi muli cihugo cirebe, obone balyâlyanye banalenganye, orhasômeragwa. Bakubwîra mpu mukulu mulebe, akulirwe n’owundi mukulu, na ntyo na ntyo. <verse eid="ECC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8"/>Bakubwîre mpu binjà bya lubaga birhumire, na mpu mwâmi balwîra.<verse eid="ECC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amagerha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9"/>Osîma ensaranga, arhabona ezamuyigusa, n’osîma obugale arhajira aha burhenga; kunali kurhebwa okwo nakwo. <verse eid="ECC 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10"/>Aha ebirugu biluga ho haluga n’abasengezi; na nnabyo cici agwêrhage? Kusîma kwa masù. <verse eid="ECC 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11"/>Îrò ly’omukozi lirhahimwa kununa, ciru akalya hinyi erhi hinji; ci omugale yêhe obwigusi bwâge burhamuzigira ahunga.<verse eid="ECC 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12"/>Hali obulenzi mbona buluga hano igulu: obugale nnabwo abîka bumulerhere omuhona. <verse eid="ECC 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13"/>Oburhunzi bwahona, bunarhume aherwa n’ebyâge, aburhe omwâna amango arhacigwêrhi bici. <verse eid="ECC 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14"/>Aburhagwa bushugunu, ashubibà mushugunu; omukolo gwâge gurhamurhengeragamwo ehyasigala omu nfune. <verse eid="ECC 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15"/>Kuli kulenga bwenêne okubà ye shubiribà mushugunu: bunguke buci akûzirage omu kubà busha akolîre? <verse eid="ECC 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16"/>N’ensiku zâge zoshi mwo zihwêra omu burhè, omu mutula, omu ntanya, endwâla n’omungo.<verse eid="ECC 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17"/>Alaga oku mbwîne: okasîma omuntu, akasîma kuli kulya n’okunywa, n’okubona obuluhûkiro omu mukolo akola hano igulu, erhi n’ensiku Nyamuzinda ahâga omuntu zanayisha zâgera, bulâlya kwo omuntu analemirwe ntyo. <verse eid="ECC 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18"/>N’amango Nyamuzinda ahîre omuntu obugale mpu ahirhire, bulya bugale omuntu anabuyumanyanyagye, abulye, asîme anacîsîme omu mukolo gwâge, bulâlya eri ngalo ya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ECC 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19"/>Lyoki ciru omuntu ankarhangibà nk’ayibagira ensiku z’obuzîne bwâge, amango Nyamuzinda aciyîbagizize omuntu n’ago masîma.<verse eid="ECC 5:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1"/>Hali obundi buhanya ncibwîne hano igulu, oku irhwe ly’abantu. <verse eid="ECC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2"/>Omuntu Nyamuzinda ahîre okugala, okubîka n’okukengwa: olya orhaganya buligo arhanabulanga. Nyamuzinda amuyêreke arhanamuzigire alya, ci kwône aleke ow’embuga abè ye birya. Kuli kurhebwa okwo, kunali kulibuka bwenêne! <verse eid="ECC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3"/>Nîsi erhi omuntu waligwêrhe bâna bâge igana n’okulama myâka minji, owanaga likola àli mulamu. Bayumve mpu bamusigîsize ebyâge abule ciru n’enshinda abishwamwo! Lyo nkaderhaga nti «ecimomano co cikulu».<verse eid="ECC 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4"/>Arhenge omu mwizimya, anajè omu mwizimya; ci kwône naye izîno lyâge lijirekwo omwizimya. <verse eid="ECC 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5"/>Arhabonaga izûba, arhanabwîni buluhûkiro; omurhanzi arhalushiri owâbo. <verse eid="ECC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6"/>Ciru ankalamire kabirhi kabirhi myâka cihumbi, buzira kulya oku byâge, kàli bombi haguma bahwêrîre?<verse eid="ECC 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7"/>Okulya kw’omuntu arhamira, n’enda erhi erhanasîma; <verse eid="ECC 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8"/>Bici omurhimanya alushire omusirhe? Kurhi rhwankaderha oku omukenyi ayishi oku omuntu ayôrha omu bandi? <verse eid="ECC 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9"/>K’ehyaboneka hyo hikulu oku hiri omu nda? Kuli kurhebwa ganali mango gafire busha.<verse eid="ECC 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10"/>Okwarhanziribà bamanyire izîno lyâkwo, banamanyire omuntu ali cici: arhankalwîsa omulushire misî<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwene omuntu yêne arhankahashirhegeka akalamo kâge, ntà mango amanye ebyâbà irhondo, ebyarhamanyaga embere z’amango. Co cirhumire kuli kwinjà mwene omuntu amanye akacîbera irhwe. Ci kwônene aleke Nyamuzinda yêne ajire eby’alonzize. Rhurhegesirwe rhumuyêmêre.</char></note>. <verse eid="ECC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11"/>Omuntu akaluza ebinwa, analuze n’ebi aciyunjuliza, kucirigi kwa bici okuluza ebinwa? <verse eid="ECC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12"/>Ndi omanyire ebyankakwânana omuntu ocizîne, ngasi lusiku luja oku nkuba lunakwirhe obulenzi, naye anayisha ayonda nka cizunguzungu! Ndi wakamubwîra ebyayishibà bano igulu enyuma zâge?<verse eid="ECC 6:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7"/>
  <para style="ms1">Ecigabi ca kabiri</para>
  <para style="s1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1"/>Izîno lyo likulu oku mavurha g’engulo ndârhi; n’olusiku lw’okufà lwo lukulu aha lusiku lw’okuburhwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2"/>Aha omuntu ankajà aha balya, ankajà aha balaka, bulya bwo buzinda bwa ngasi muntu, n’omuntu naye anakengêre okwo. <verse eid="ECC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3"/>Aha omuntu ankasheka ankabà burhè, n’obukali bw’ebusù buyinjiha. <verse eid="ECC 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4"/>Omurhimanya anakazigerêreza oguli ebufîre n’omusirhe yêhe akengêrage ahâli amasîma. <verse eid="ECC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5"/>Aha omuntu ankayumvîrhiza olwimbo lw’omusirhe, ankayumvîrhiza ihano ly’omurhimanya. <verse eid="ECC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6"/>Bulyâla olwimbo lw’omusirhe kwo lujira olubî nka nshâli za mishûgi îdako ly’enyungu; kuli kurhebwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7"/>N’amasheka ganahwinjagaze omurhimanya, n’amasîma ganahûse omurhima.<verse eid="ECC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8"/>Aha wankabà aha barhondêra akantu wankabà aha kâshwinjwa, omurhima gw’okulinda, gwo mukulu aha bwihâmbi. <verse eid="ECC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9"/>Orhahîra okacîdîrhibula duba-duba, bulyâla murhima gwa musirhe gubà mwo entanya. <verse eid="ECC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10"/>Orhaderhaga erhi: cici cirhumire ensiku zàli burhanzi zilusha eziri buno? Kulya kubà eryôla idôso lirhali lya burhimanya. <verse eid="ECC 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11"/>Oburhimanya kwo buyinjiha nka kashambala, abâli hanôla igulu bwo bukwânana. <verse eid="ECC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12"/>Bulyâla olwâkiro lw’oburhimanya lwo na lwâkiro lw’ensaranga, n’obunguke bw’obumanye kunali kulya oburhimanya buciza nnabo. <verse eid="ECC 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13"/>Orhangilola omukolo gwa Nyamuzinda: ndî wankagondôla ehi agondesire? <verse eid="ECC 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14"/>Olusiku lw’obusîme, onashagaluke; n’olusiku lw’obuhanya, olole kwône: Nyamuzinda wabijiraga byombi, mpu ly’omuntu alekîbona akantu enyuma zâge yêne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nk’oku biyôsire oku buzindazinda bw’ebindi bigabi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 3:11">3, 11</ref>.<ref loc="ECC 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 6:12">6, 12</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:7">8, 7</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:12">9, 12</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 10:14">10, 14</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 11:5">11, 5</ref></char>), omuhanûzi akengêzize kulusha oku omuntu arhankamanya ebyayisha, arhankanahashicîbwîra yêne ehi Nyamuzinda alongîze igulu. Ntyo oku omuntu akajira, kuli kuyêmêra ebi Nyamuzinda alemire nka kulya yêne alonzagya mpu biyôrhe.</char></note>. <verse eid="ECC 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15"/>Omu buzîne bwâni bw’omurhebwa, bàbwîne omushinganyanya afà omu bushinganyanya bwâge, n’enkola-maligo yasigala omu maligo gâyo. <verse eid="ECC 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16"/>Orhabâga mushinganyanya okurhalusire olugero, orhacijiraga murhimanya omu masù g’abandi; cici carhuma wacîlibuza? <verse eid="ECC 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17"/>Orhahîraga okabîha okurhalusire olugero, omanye wankanasiraha; carhuma wafà embere amango gâwe gahike. <verse eid="ECC 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18"/>Kukwânîne omuntu asêze ehi buzira kuleka hira, bulyâla okenga Nyamuzinda, anabihikekwo byombi. <verse eid="ECC 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19"/>Oburhimanya bunahè omurhimanya emisî elushire eya barhambo ikumi omu lugo luguma. <verse eid="ECC 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20"/>Hanôla igulu harhali omuntu mushinganyanya olya wankakola aminjà buzira kulogorha ciru n’eriguma. <verse eid="ECC 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21"/>Obwo kwo biri ntyo, orhahîraga okâyumvirhiza emyanzi minji-minji, wa nkanayumva baderha oku mwambali wâwe akuderhaga buligo. <verse eid="ECC 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22"/>Nâwe wêne omurhima gwâwe gurhahabiri kanga wamâderha abandi kubî! <verse eid="ECC 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23"/>Ebyo byoshi nabigeziremwo n’oburhimanya, namanya nti nnandi murhimanya, ci kwône bindushire bulî. <verse eid="ECC 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24"/>Akantu kali kandushire bulî, kali emwîna kuli kuli, ndi wankakahika-kwo? <verse eid="ECC 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25"/>Nashubijà aho nacîhangâna nti nongereze oburhimanya haguma n’oluhembo; nti manye oku obubî linali isirhe, n’oku okuhwinjagala kunali kuhaba. <verse eid="ECC 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26"/>Ka ntabugâna ebirhalusire olufù bululu: omukazi wa! bulyâla omukazi gubà murhego, n’omurhima gwâge kabà keshe, n’amaboko gâge bubà budagulè: orhînya Nyamuzinda ye fuma abakazi, ci enkola-maligo erhafuma. <verse eid="ECC 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27"/>Alaga ebi, mbwîne, Koheleti okudesire, erhi nankabihira haguma byoshi. <verse eid="ECC 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28"/>Ishiriza, nalonzize nalonza, ci ntarhôlaga. Mulume muguma omu cihu mbî, nêci mmubwîne, mukazi muguma muli boshi ntamubwîni. <verse eid="ECC 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29"/>Alaga kwône ebi mbwîne obwo: Nyamuzinda ajizire omuntu mwîrhohye, naye yêne ye dwîrhage alonza okuhalûla ebihazire!<verse eid="ECC 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1"/>Ndi oli ak’omurhimanya, na ndi badôsa anamanyishuza? Oburhimanya bunarhume omuntu ashagaluka, n’obusù bwâge, bunahinduke n’obwo bwàli bukali. <verse eid="ECC 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2"/>Naderha obwo: nti oshimbe irhegeko lya mwâmi erhi ndahiro ya Nyamuzinda erhuma. <verse eid="ECC 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3"/>Orhalirhibaga duba-duba: orhacînanîrizagya omu bwôrhere bubî, bulyâla okwalonzize kwoshi ajira.<verse eid="ECC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4"/>Akanwa ka mwâmi kali kaguma, na ndi wankamubwîra, erhi: «Bici ebyo wajira?» <verse eid="ECC 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5"/>Omuntu ojira oku arhegesirwe arhahanyagala; n’omurhimanya ayôsire amanyire oku hali amango hali n’okutwa olubanja. <verse eid="ECC 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6"/>Bulya nêci hali amango hali n’okutûbirwa ngasi kantu katûbirwa olubanja, na ntà muntu oyôrha ama nyire kurhi lwatûbwa. <verse eid="ECC 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7"/>Bulya kandi ntà muntu oyishi ebyâbà na ndi wabwîra omuntu hano bibà. Empûsi erhabà ya ndi akaderhaga mpu arhayilika, olusiku n’olufù nabyo birhali bya ndi. <verse eid="ECC 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8"/>Amatabâro nago garhalindisibwa, n’obumînya burhaciza nnabwo.<verse eid="ECC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9"/>Ebyo byoshi, mbimanyire, omu kulolêreza ebibà bano igulu, amango omuntu arhegesire owâbo muntu, buhanya bwâge. <verse eid="ECC 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10"/>Ci kandi mbwînage abaminya bahêkwa ebwa kubishwa, n’abantu banarhenge omu ka Nyamuzinda bajibahera obukenge ekà, kulya kubà bajizire ntyo, kuli kurhebwa! <verse eid="ECC 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11"/>Kulya kubà olusiku batwîraga omuntu olubanja arhali lyo anajuha, abantu nabo banakazibà bayunjwîre iralà ly’okujira okubî.<verse eid="ECC 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12"/>Enkola-maligo enagakole kal’igana enabuli lama. Mmanyire nêci oku banaderhe mpu abarhînya Nyamuzinda banabone iragi kulya kurhînya Nyamuzinda kurhumire. <verse eid="ECC 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13"/>Mmanyire n’oku ntà kusîma kw’omumînya n’okûla ma kwâge kunali kulibuka kwa cizunguzungu, kulya kubà arharhînya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ECC 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14"/>Ci kwône binji birhebana hanôla igulu, bulyâla hali abashinga nyanya barhogerwa n’ebyali bikwânîne ebijiro by’enkola-maligo; hali n’enkola-maligo zibona okwàli kukwânîne ebijiro by’abashinganyanya. Ndesire nti kurhebwa okwo!<verse eid="ECC 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndà bakolera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15"/>Niehe okusîma kwo ndesire kukulu, bulya iragi ly’omuntu mwône libà omu kulya, omu kunywa n’omu kucisîmîsa. Ebyo byo bilusa omukolo gwâge e nsiku z’obuzîne Nyamuzinda amuhîre hanôla igulu. Obuzigire <verse eid="ECC 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16"/>Erhi mbà namâcîhangâna okumanya oburhimanya, nalonza okulola bushanja buci omuntu ajira hano igulu. Omanye oku omuntu arhabona lya mûshi arhabona lya budufu. <verse eid="ECC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17"/>Mbwînage n’omukolo gwa Nyamuzinda gwoshi: omuntu arhankavulûla omukolo gujirwa hano igulu, gulya gwakubwîriza ecirhuma omuntu arhama alonza buzira kuhikakwo ehi alonza, n’omurhimanya ciru akacîhamba mpu ayishi ecirhuma, arhankacihikakwo.<verse eid="ECC 8:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebiyêrekîre obuzîne bw’omuntu: Ntakwinja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1"/>Bulya nêci narhimanyize kuli ebyo byoshi, nayumva oku abashinganyanya n’abarhimanya n’emikolo yâbo omu nfune za Nyamuzinda babà. Oli obuzigire, oli enshômbo, ntà ciguma omuntu ayishi n’omu masù gâge, byombi biri birhebanyi. <verse eid="ECC 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2"/>Buzinda buguma bagwêrhe boshi: omushinganyanya n’omumînya ocigwêrhe bwinjà n’orhacigwêrhi bwinjà, owarherekêra n’orharherekêra; kwo nakuguma. Naye kwo na kwo, omuntu mwinjà n’omunya-byâha, owacîgasha n’owarhînya kwacîgasha. <verse eid="ECC 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3"/>Kubî okwôla, okubona obuzinda bw’ebijirwa hano igulu byoshi buli buguma kuli boshi n’okubona omurhima gw’omuntu guyunjwîre mababale, n’okubona isirhe libîkîrwe abantu amango bacizîne n’e nyumpa amango bamâfà wâni! <verse eid="ECC 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4"/>Bulya nêci ôciri omu buzîne erhi analangâlire, n’akabwa kazîne ko kakulu oku ntale efîre. <verse eid="ECC 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5"/>Abazîne bamanyire ciru oku kufâ bafâ, abafîre bôhe barhamanyiri cici; barhacigwêrhi luhembo, bulyâla ntâye ocibakengîre. <verse eid="ECC 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6"/>Obuzigire bwâbo, enshombo zâbo n’obwâgalwa bwâbo, byoshi byahezire; barhâcishangire ciru n’eriguma oku bikolwa hanôla igulu.<verse eid="ECC 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7"/>Kanya, olye ehigati hyâwe n’obusîme onanywe orhwamvu rhwâwe n’omurhima gushongwîre; bulyâla Nyamuzinda mîra ageraga ebijiro byâwe. <verse eid="ECC 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8"/>Okaziyôrha oyambîrhe ebyêru-byêru, n’amavurha garhakalaga oku irhwe lyâwe! <verse eid="ECC 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9"/>Oyanke akalamo n’omukazi ozigîre, ensiku z’obuzîne bw’akalenganè Nyamuzinda akuhîre hanôla igulu, bulyâla kwo walemirwe ensiku onalibukira hanôla igulu. <verse eid="ECC 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10"/>Ngasi bushanja onabwîne wankarhangira, onabukole amango onacizîne, bulyâla ekuzimu wayishijà, erhabà kukola, nîsi erhi kuganja, erhi kumanya erhi kurhimanya.<verse eid="ECC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhanya burhalaliza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11"/>Nshubirisinza hanôla nshi: abalibisi bakulu, arhali bo bajà mashigwè g’okulibirha, n’abazibu-zibu arhali bo balwa. Ntà mugati abarhimanya bajira, na ntà bugale ab’obukengêre bajira n’abanya-bumanye ntà burhonyi bajira, bulyâla boshi banarhibukîrwe n’obuhanya. <verse eid="ECC 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12"/>Omuntu arhabà ayishi ensa yâge: kulyâla enfî zigwârhwa omu kêshe kafulike, nîsi erhi ebinyunyi oku murhego, kwo n’omuntu naye agwârhwa n’obuhanya, amango bumurhibukîre buzira kulâliza.<verse eid="ECC 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oburhimanya bw’omukenyi burhakengwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13"/>Mbwîne okundi kubî hanôla igulu, nabwîne nka kurhalusire olugero. 9, 10: Kuli kwinjà ensiku z’akalamo kâwe hano igulu ozigeze omu kukazijira aminjà. Bulya amango wâbà wafîre ntâco ciru n’eciguma wakacijira. <verse eid="ECC 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14"/>Hali lugo luguma lusungunu, lurhalimwo bantu banji, Mwâmi muguma muzibu ayisha alurhêra, alugorha analuyûbakira ebinene n’ebinja. <verse eid="ECC 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15"/>Ci kwône abugânamwo omukenyi murhimanya, ye wafungiraga olwo lugo n’oburhimanya bwâge. Oyo mukenyi barharhamagimuyibagira! <verse eid="ECC 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16"/>Kwo kuderhaga nti oburhimanya bwo bukulu aha misî, ci kwône oburhimanya bw’omukenyi barhalonza okubumanya, n’ebinwa byâge barhabiyumvîrhiza. <verse eid="ECC 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17"/>Ebinwa binjà by’omurhimanya banabiyumvirhize kulusha okuyâma kw’omwâmi w’abasirhe. <verse eid="ECC 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18"/>Oburhimanya bwo bukulu aha matumu, ci kwône ishembo liguma linashereze binjà binji.<verse eid="ECC 9:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1"/>Enzi zifîre zinashereze enjebe y’amavurha g’amalâshi, isirhe lisungunu linakole kulusha oburhimanya n’olukengwa. <verse eid="ECC 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2"/>Omurhimanya bwinjà ahêka, n’omusirhe agende oluhengu. <verse eid="ECC 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3"/>Omusirhe ajè omu mulimbwa kwône: abule irhwe anayêreke abandi oku ali musirhe. <verse eid="ECC 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4"/>E erhi mwâmi akakuhêkakwo oburhè, orhahinyagya, bulyâla okurhûza kunarhume omuntu arhalogorha. <verse eid="ECC 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5"/>Hali obubî mbwîne hano nshi kulinziribà nka kuhaba kw’omukulu: <verse eid="ECC 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6"/>isirhe libè lyo bayîmika, n’abagale bakeresibwe halya hababonêsa nshonyi. <verse eid="ECC 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7"/>Ndwîrhe nabona abajà bagenda oku nfarasi n’abarhwâli bagende n’amagulu nka bajà.<verse eid="ECC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8"/>Ohumba omwîna anagugwemwo, n’ohumba olukûta, enjoka enamulume. <verse eid="ECC 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9"/>Olengeza amabuye, ganamuyagaze, obeza enshâli naye hali amango acîyagaza. <verse eid="ECC 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10"/>Embasha ekatûha, kubula carhyâza kurhuma, omuntu anayibande n’emisî; ci kwône obunguke bw’oburhimanya, kuli kuhasha. <verse eid="ECC 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11"/>Enjoka erhi yankaluma omuntu, kubula cashungurhira kurhuma, burhali bunguke bwa mushâke. <verse eid="ECC 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12"/>Akanwa k’abarhimanya binjà kaderha, akanwa k’omusirhe yêhe ko kanamuheza.<verse eid="ECC 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obugula n’isirhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13"/>Emyanzi yâge ayirhangira ya bihalârhi, ayishwinje likola isirhe. <verse eid="ECC 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14"/>Omusirhe ye luza emyanzi: omuntu arhishi ebyâbà; mbwîraga ndi wankamubwîriza ebyayishibà enyuma zâge? <verse eid="ECC 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15"/>Omukolo gw’abasirhe gunabashologorhe, orhamanyiri njira arhankajà omu lugo.<verse eid="ECC 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16"/>Wamâhera we cihugo mwâmi ali murhumba, n’abarhambo balegerere ha lya kurhenga sêzi. <verse eid="ECC 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17"/>Iragi ly’ecihugo omwâmi aburhwa muluzi, n’abarhambo balye amango gakwânîne, kuderha mpu babone emisî, ci arhali mpu banywe. <verse eid="ECC 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18"/>Okubà ntabiruba kunarhume omutungo gwahonongoka n’okubula cakombêra kunarhume enyumpa yaloba. <verse eid="ECC 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19"/>Ci kwône mpu ntâye bahanzize okusheka nk’ali oku cîbo! mpu amamvu ye mushagalusa! mpu n’ogwêrhe igerha erhi ntâco arhagwêrhi! <verse eid="ECC 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20"/>Orhahîra okasigira mwâmi enfûlago, ciru akabà omu nkengêro orhahîra, orhahehêreraga omugale, ciru akabà omu lwâwe oli, bulyâla akanyunyi kanahêke emyanzi, n’okubà omwanzi gujira ebyûbi.<verse eid="ECC 10:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1"/>Kwêba omugati gwâwe oku mîshi, wazinda erhi washubigurhôla. <verse eid="ECC 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2"/>Obegere bantu nda erhi munâni bulyâla orhamanyiri buhanya buci bwakayisha hano igulu. <verse eid="ECC 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3"/>Ebitù bikayunjula nkuba, binayidubulire oku idaho. N’omurhi gukakulumba, njira nyanya erhi njira îdako gulya murhi ho gunahwêra halya gwahongokeraga. <verse eid="ECC 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4"/>Osingiriza empûsi arhamîra, ololêreza ebitù arhasârûla. <verse eid="ECC 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5"/>Nka kula orhîshi enjira y’empûsi, orhîshi n’amahwe g’omukazi ôli izîmi, kwo orhakanamanya n’omukolo gwa Nyamuzinda orhegeka byoshi. <verse eid="ECC 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6"/>Sêzi oyanke emburho yâwe oyîmire na bijingo orhayôrhaga kwône. Bulyâla muli ebyo byombi, orhamanyiri ciguma cakubêra; akanaba byombi-byombi bihisize haguma omu bwinjà.<verse eid="ECC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obukulu n’oburhò</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7"/>Omûshi guyinjiha, n’amasù gasîma gabone izûba. <verse eid="ECC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8"/>Omuntu akalama myâka minji, akwânîne ayikolêse yoshi, akengêre n’oku ensiku z’omudumbi zabà nyinji; ngasi hyâyishe erhi na kalenganè. <verse eid="ECC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9"/>We mwâna osîme obu ociri musole, onacîshinge ensiku ociri murhò oshimbe enjira omurhima gukuhire, n’enyifinjo amasù gakuyêresire. Ci kwône omanye oku muli ebyo byoshi, Nyamuzinda akuhamagala omu lubanja. <verse eid="ECC 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10"/>Okûle oburhè omu murhima ohêke kuli n’omubiri gwâwe ogurhenzekwo ngasi mababale. Ci kwône obusole n’ensiku z’emviri nyêru, byoshi kunali kurhebwa.<verse eid="ECC 11:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1"/>Onakazikengêra omulemi wâwe ensiku ociri murhò, oku ensiku mbî zirhaciyisha, n’oku erhaciyisha erya myâka wayishiderha erhi «ntayirikwo eyo». <verse eid="ECC 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2"/>Onakazimukengêra oku izûba n’omûshi, omwêzi n’enyenyêzi birhacijàmwo omwizimya; n’oku ebitù birhacigaluka n’enkuba yahumbûka. <verse eid="ECC 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3"/>Okazimukengêra olusiku abalanzi b’enyumpa bageramwo omusisi, olusiku abalume bazibu-zibu bagombamwo lulya abakazi balekamwo okushwa, bulyâla omûshi gwamâhorha aha kabonezo, <verse eid="ECC 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4"/>n’olumvi lukola luyigale emuhanda; amango olwanjikwa lurhacivuga, amango akanyunyi karhacilyogôla, n’amango abimbiza bahulika, <verse eid="ECC 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5"/>galya mango abantu barhînya okusôka, banagaliyahagira omu njira. Amango omulehe guyâsa, n’oluzige luyigurhe n’amango omurhi gw’entoborhobo gujakwo ecirhumbwe, galya mango omuntu ajà ebwa nyumpa yâge y’ensiku n’amango. N’abalasi bajinduluke omu muhanda; <verse eid="ECC 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6"/>embere ehigozi hy’amarhale hitwîke, embere itara ly’izahabu libereke, embere akabindi kaberekere aha iriba, embere omugozi gw’adôma gutwîkire omu iriba; <verse eid="ECC 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7"/>n’e mbêre akatulo kashubire omu idaho nk’oku kanarhengagamwo, n’obuzîne emwa Nyamuzinda wabuhânaga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngasi kantu koshi ojira karhenga omu idaho, mwo kananashubire. ci kwône omuntu ajira akantu karharhenga omu idaho. Ako kantu karhengaga emwa Nyamuzinda, yo kananashubire (Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 3:20-21">3, 20-21</ref></char>).</char></note>. <verse eid="ECC 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8"/>Busha-busha mâshi, gwârhi Koheleti, byoshi busha!<verse eid="ECC 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushwinja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9"/>Kurhaderhwa kwôhe oku Koheleti àli murhimanya, ci kandi ayigîrize obumanye; ayanka ahira oku munzâni, agerekanya anakubûla migani minji. <verse eid="ECC 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10"/>Koheleti àli alonzize okuyandika emyanzi minunu n’okusiriba bwinjà enkengêro z’okunali. <verse eid="ECC 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11"/>Ebinwa by’abarhimanya kwo biri nka kababo, kwo biyôrha nka birhi bigwîke, kulonza obwôloloke bw’obusò bwâge kurhuma lungere abikolêsa. <verse eid="ECC 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12"/>Kulusha aho, mwâna wâni, oyôrhe omanyire oku okujira ebitabu bubà bushanja burhayunjula, n’oku amasomo manji ganarhamye omubiri. <verse eid="ECC 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13"/>Okushwinja emyanzi: byoshi biyumvikîne. Orhînye Nyamuzinda onashimbe amarhegeko gâge, bulya gwo mukolo gwa ngasi muntu. <verse eid="ECC 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14"/>Kulya kubà ebijiro byoshi, Nyamuzinda anabihêke omu lubanja, na kandi anabone na ngasi hifulike, hibè hinjà hibè hibî.<verse eid="ECC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12"/>
</usx>
